  partName: Gear
  description: The Gear is a tiny, thin-flat component located at the middle-center-front
    of the engine, playing a crucial role in the transmission of power and torque.
    Composed of Material.007, this gear provides a durable and wear-resistant surface,
    enabling smooth and efficient power transfer. Interestingly, the gear's thin-flat
    shape allows it to be mounted in compact spaces, making it an essential component
    in the engine's overall design and functionality.
